    <p class="gs-eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective August 22, 2026.</strong> These terms apply when you access GoldShore websites, public content, forms, and protected online services. If you enter a signed agreement with GoldShore, that agreement controls where it conflicts with these website terms.</p>
