    <h2>Accounts and protected access</h2>
    <p>Some services require an approved identity, Cloudflare Access authorization, API credential, or service token. You are responsible for activity under credentials issued to you and for promptly reporting suspected loss or misuse. Access may be limited or revoked to protect the service or enforce these terms.</p>
    <h2>Content and intellectual property</h2>
    <p>GoldShore and its licensors retain rights in the site, software, design, analysis, and original content. You may link to public pages and quote short passages with attribution. These terms do not grant a license to copy, resell, train on, or create competing datasets from protected content or services.</p>
