    <h2>Availability and changes</h2>
    <p>We may update, suspend, or discontinue public or protected features. Unless a signed agreement says otherwise, the services are provided on an “as available” basis without a public uptime or support commitment. We may update these terms by posting a revised effective date.</p>
    <h2>Responsibility</h2>
    <p>To the extent permitted by applicable law, GoldShore is not responsible for indirect or consequential loss arising from use of the public site or reliance on its informational content. Nothing here excludes rights or responsibilities that cannot legally be excluded. Contract-specific warranties, remedies, and liability limits belong in the applicable signed agreement.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms can be sent through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Do not include passwords, private keys, API tokens, or financial account credentials.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-copy { max-width: 78ch; margin-inline: auto; }
  .legal-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 7rem); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .legal-copy h2 { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .legal-copy p { line-height: 1.75; color: var(--gs-text-secondary); }
</style>
